        <mxCell id="FXDBDVxD3EHXyxP99C6I-191" value="Draw GUI:&lt;br&gt;- draw self&lt;br&gt;- close button closes gui&lt;br&gt;- resolution button cycles through stored resolutions (holds)&lt;br&gt;- Tutorials checkbox toggles (holds)&lt;br&gt;- fullscreen checkbox toggles (holds)&lt;br&gt;- Apply writes all held settings to saved settings files and updates for the current settings&lt;div&gt;- defaults button resets all to default and updates the savefile.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Exit will exit to MM (only in OW)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Forfeit will take 25% hp from all units and then send back to OW (only in encounter)&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=6;fillColor=#008a00;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#005700;" parent="FXDBDVxD3EHXyxP99C6I-189" vertex="1">
